# Enforce LF line endings for every text file in this repository.
# - Overrides core.autocrlf on every platform: checkout AND commit stay LF.
# - The `eol` check in scripts/validate-skill-system.py fails validation if any
#   tracked text file contains CRLF, so regressions cannot land unnoticed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types (explicit so they are never treated as text).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.pack binary
